# This file contains a list of files that will be excluded from Shopify CLI
# operations such as push, pull, dev, etc.
#
# ─── DYNAMIC / MERCHANT-EDITED CONTENT (DO NOT PUSH) ─────────────────────────
# JSON templates + settings_data hold section settings, images, blocks, and
# theme-editor customizations. Pushing them would wipe live content and force
# the client to rebuild pages. Code (sections/*.liquid, assets, snippets,
# layout, settings_schema) is still pushed — only the *content layer* is locked.
#
# Do NOT upload these via the Admin Assets API either — that bypasses this file
# and will overwrite live editor settings.

# Theme editor global settings (logo, colors, contact, etc.)
config/settings_data.json

